AdqpBkR8kjiO1lEKdExSXfLx076GVwS1KZd7j9aWmMjfnighK7OUe7DzK4NEfuztIG0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQT11fuL77AobA89Zdj-2M2KOqZH8jv1W5fl9uYxuULDuA&oe=6B0313C8"}, {"file_name": "vr battle of battleship screen shot 2560 x 1440 210407 4.png", "id": "673505496683402", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75411996_673505500016735_2170965674423752804_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=WOSyOEyUPJgQ7kNvwHjjP0f&_nc_oc=AdrSJ0nsBwgIolPnfHpt9kWPlEB5TyaAPxVRUTKS2W37AkDa473LRHLQLUK5g3_C0hA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQrA_PSwI7BQ7elQOEwSkiTSaYidcCqc_tjOaUIYLWTbQ&oe=6B0329AB"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "VR Battle of Battleship", "keywords": [], "long_description": "1. Basic Operation:\n- You can start the battle by firing the main guns of the battleship.\n- The following modern weapons are added to increase the tension of the game:\n    - Your battleship has CIWS Beam for defense\n    - Enemy battleship has Anti-ship missiles\n\n2. The Physical Law Modification:\nTo realize the short-time and amazing spectacle battle of huge battleships, some of the physical laws in this Real-Time Simulation World are carefully modified.\n\n3. Conclusion:\nWe believe that the amazing spectacle battle of the huge battleship in VR world is established by the\nunique modification of the physical laws in this application.\nPlease enjoy this VR real-time simulation of battle of battleship.\n\nNull City Realtime Simulation, Development Team", "short_description": "\u201cVR Battle of Battleship\u201d is a Real-Time Simulation Game of the one-on-one fight of the Ultimate Huge Battleships; IOWA-class and Yamato-class in VR world.\nFrom the beginning of this application, you can choose IOWA or YAMATO and start the battle.\nLet fire the main guns of your huge battleships!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url